  "description": "Yoonseol Choi, a business student and orphan, lives with her beloved grandfather. But when he falls gravely ill, her whole world is shaken. Before his time runs out, his final wish is to see her marry a good man. Determined to fulfill his request at any cost, Yoonseol embarks on a desperate search for a suitable husband. Love was never her priority, but could an unexpected romance change her heart?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list.nhn?novelId=1036907), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8032169)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nLINE Webtoon Indonesian ([S1](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/our-secret-marriage/list?title_no=6151), [S2](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/our-secret-marriage-season-2/list?title_no=10177)), [Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=834181), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11857476)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.webtoons.com/en/romance/our-secret-marriage/list?title_no=7487), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/our-secret-marriage/list?title_no=6868), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/our-secret-marriage/list?title_no=6931), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/our-secret-marriage/list?title_no=7663), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003658) \n\n***Note:** Based on a Korean novel but first being published in Indonesia. one of author pen name use Indonesian name.   \nS1 artist: VBi  \nS2 artist: Lity*",
